  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ProACT Bangladesh- Resilience Strengthening through Agri-Food Systems Transformation in Cox&#xbf;s Bazar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project aims to build livelihoods and skills building opportunities for both host communities and Rohingya population (to the extent possible) and promote economic inclusion in the opportunities presented by the response. Strengthening of local supply chains and markets, as well development of private sector partnership across the sub-sectors of fisheries and crop production is a strategic focus. &lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
